# The same program on rewind, which is where Delve's trace-only commands live:
# qRRCmd when/checkpoint/info/delete, vRun restarts (checkpoint and trace
# start), reverse continue, and reverse instruction stepping.
break main.consume if id == 0
continue
print id
locals
stack 6
next
next
rev step-instruction
step-instruction
checkpoint c1
step
restart c1
locals
checkpoints
clear-checkpoint c1
checkpoints
rev continue
clear 1
break main.deep
continue
print n
stack 4
rev step-instruction
step-instruction
exit
